    Sparkles, BrainCircuit, RefreshCw, Layers, ChevronRight, 
    HelpCircle, X, BookOpen, 
    Info, ShieldAlert,
    Compass, Zap, Globe, MessageSquarePlus, Send,
    ChevronDown, Ban,
